&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Accounts payable to associated companies as of December 31, 2025 and 2024 consist of amounts due to CIG and its affiliates for reimbursement of operations and capital expenditures incurred on our behalf under the terms of the operating agreement with CIG. Neither CIG nor Young have employees. Employees of KMI provide services to CIG and us. These costs are reflected, as appropriate, in the "Operation, maintenance and payroll tax expenses" and "Capitalized costs" lines in the table below.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
