          <xhtml:span style="font-size: 18.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;">Recorded pursuant to Docket No. RP14-232.<xhtml:span style="mso-spacerun: yes;"></xhtml:span>The remaining balance at the end of the current filing period will be refunded through adjustments to future period fuel retention rates.</xhtml:span>
